    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="12" relname="span">A system with various ways of carrying out the same task (flexibility) will provide various methods to choose from.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="13" relname="span">Whatever method is easier or quicker to the user will speed up the task (efficiency).</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="14" relname="span">A good example is the family of Windows operating systems.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="16" relname="span">Microsoft provided at least two methods of opening windows explorer.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="19" relname="span">One method has never changed from Windows 95 to Windows 2003 (consistency).</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="20" relname="span">This method is RIGHT CLICK START, EXPLORE.</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="6" relname="evaluation">Neat, simple and fast (efficient).</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="18" relname="span">The other method is CLICK START, PROGRAMS (for Windows 95,98) ALL PROGRAMS, ACCESSORIES (for Windows XP),</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="8" relname="elaboration">and its just PROGRAMS for Windows 2000</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="18" relname="evaluation">%$#@!</segment>
        <segment id="11" parent="17" relname="volitional-result">You have to think hard where they put windows explorer with each new version of Windows.</segment>
        <group id="12" type="span"/>
        <group id="13" type="span" parent="1" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="14" type="span" parent="2" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="15" type="span" parent="3" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="16" type="span" parent="15" relname="span"/>
        <group id="17" type="span" parent="21" relname="span"/>
        <group id="18" type="span" parent="17" relname="span"/>
        <group id="19" type="span" parent="4" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="20" type="span" parent="5" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="21" type="span" parent="16" relname="elaboration"/>
    </body>
</rst>
